 ## Requirements implemented
 
-Latest change: **REQ-BF-002 - Click analytics, link expiry and alias case bug fix**
+Latest change: **REQ-AMBIGUOUS - Make the shortener enterprise-ready and faster**
 
-- GET /api/v1/links/{code}/stats returns total clicks, unique visitors, clicks by day, top referrers and top user-agent families.
-- Clicks are recorded off the redirect hot path; analytics failures never fail a redirect.
-- Links accept an optional expires_at on create and PATCH; expired links return 410 on redirect.
-- Bug fix - a custom alias created as 'MyLink' must be reachable at /MyLink and /mylink (aliases are case-insensitive); generated codes stay case-sensitive.
+- Read-through redirect cache
+- Token-bucket rate limiting
+- Prometheus metrics
+- Redirect latency target
+- API-key authentication on write endpoints

